ng / Data Analysis / Quantitative Research / SQL\n\nDevOps & Infrastructure\nLinux / Docker / GitHub\n\nArchitecture & Product\nSystem Design / API Design / Workflow Automation / RBAC / A/B Testing / Project Management","zh":"AI 与 Agentic Engineering\nAgentic Engineering\n\n前端与交互\nReact / TypeScript / JavaScript / HTML / CSS / 交互设计\n\n后端与编程语言\nPython / Django REST Framework / Java\n\n数据工程与数据库\nETL / 数据处理 / 数据建模 / 数据分析 / 量化研究 / SQL\n\nDevOps 与基础设施\nLinux / Docker / GitHub\n\n系统架构与产品\n系统设计 / API 设计 / 工作流自动化 / RBAC 权限控制 / A/B 测试 / 项目管理"},"textStyle":{"fontSize":28,"fontWeight":650,"letterSpacing":-0.6,"lineHeight":1.12,"color":"#ffffff","align":"left","fontFamily":"inherit"},"boxWidth":917.48,"displayTiming":{"enterDelayMs":4000,"fadeInMs":1000}},"resumeScene4":{"type":"text","scene":4,"role":"resume-copy","core":false,"name":"2026 – Present Independent Softw","x":136.04,"y":96.98,"scale":1,"rotation":0,"opacity":1,"z":2,"visible":true,"locked":false,"flow":false,"displayGroup":"reality","text":{"en":"2026 – Present\nIndependent Software Developer\nIndependent Development / Software & Data Engineering\n- Developing an operations management platform for a UK logistics company\n- Tech: Django / Next.js / API / Data Modelling / Permissions / Workflow Automation\n- Responsible for UI/UX design, frontend and backend development, and functional testing\n\n2026\n7LEX Legal · London\nCustomer Success Executive\n- Supported clients across UK immigration and legal services\n- Responsible for client communication / onboarding / case tracking / document management\n\n2025\nMindray Medical UK · London\nMarket Research Intern\n- Analysed the UK NHS and GP market\n- Covered 7,791 GP practices and 75M+ patients\n- Responsible for market research / data analysis / product assessment / competitor analysis\n\n2021 – 2023\nBank of Guangzhou Credit Card Centre · Guangzhou\nStrategy Specialist\n- Worked across data and business operations supporting 5M+ credit card customers\n- Responsible for data analysis / automation / A-share quantitative research / AI applications / process optimisation\n- Improved operational efficiency by approximately 60% through automation\n\n2018 – 2021\nBeijing Yusys Technologies · Guangzhou\nSoftware Engineer\n- Participated in the development of banking business and data systems\n- Developed automated regulatory reporting and production data reports\n- Responsible for system development / data processing / reporting automation / information security","zh":"2026 – 至今\n独立软件开发者\n独立开发 / 软件与数据工程\n- 为英国物流公司开发运营管理平台\n- 技术：Django / Next.js / API / 数据建模 / 权限管理 / 自动化流程\n- 负责：用户交互与界面设计 / 前后端开发 / 功能测试\n\n2026\n祺正律师事务所 · 伦敦\n客户专员\n- 服务英国移民及法律服务客户\n- 负责：客户沟通 / 客户入驻 / 案件跟踪 / 文档管理\n\n2025\n迈瑞医疗英国 · 伦敦\n市场调研实习生\n- 分析英国 NHS 与 GP 市场\n- 覆盖 7,791 家 GP 诊所及 7,500 万+ 患者\n- v负责：市场研究 / 数据分析 / 产品评估 / 竞品分析\n\n2021 – 2023\n广州银行信用卡中心 · 广州\n策略流程专员\n- 参与服务 500 万+ 信用卡客户的数据与业务体系\n- 负责：数据分析 / 自动化 / A股量化研究 / AI 应用 / 流程优化\n- 通过自动化改造提升约 60% 工作效率\n\n2018 – 2021\n北京宇信科技集团股份有限公司 · 广州\n软件工程师\n- 参与银行业务及数据系统开发\n- 开发自动化监管报表及生产数据报表\n- 负责：系统开发 / 数据处理 / 报表自动化 / 信息安全"},"textStyle":{"fontSize":24,"fontWeight":650,"letterSpacing":-0.6,"lineHeight":1.12,"color":"#ffffff","align":"left","fontFamily":"inherit"},"boxWidth":1599.08,"displayTiming":{"enterDelayMs":4000,"fadeInMs":500}},"resumeScene5":{"type":"text","scene":5,"role":"resume-copy","core":false,"name":"To be updated","x":400.63,"y":558.73,"scale":1,"rotation":0,"opacity":1,"z":1,"visible":true,"locked":false,"flow":false,"displayGroup":"reality","text":{"en":"To be updated","zh":"To be updated"},"textStyle":{"fontSize":34,"fontWeight":650,"letterSpacing":-0.6,"lineHeight":1.12,"color":"#ffffff","align":"left","fontFamily":"inherit"},"boxWidth":883.95,"displayTiming":{"enterDelayMs":0,"fadeInMs":0}},"resumeScene6":{"type":"text","scene":6,"role":"resume-copy","core":false,"name":"To be updated","x":416.94,"y":585.27,"scale":1,"rotation":0,"opacity":1,"z":1,"visible":true,"locked":false,"flow":false,"displayGroup":"